<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54197" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακνίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chop up, mince</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι εἰς λεπτά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					9.376d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>pick to pieces</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					12.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τοῦ Ὁμήρου κ. λεπτά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Hes.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>scratch, irritate, stimulate</i> the scalp, <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.420
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.123
			</span></i>; <i>to be prurient</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγὼ δὲ κατακέκνισμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					973
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cut grooves in, score</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλα καὶ λίθους τραχύνουσι -ζοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diocl.Fr.
					26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>scarify, let blood from</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κνίσω</span> (prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κνήσω</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> σου τὸν πόδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Ocyp.</u>
					91
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κνισθεὶς τὸ σκέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					7.20.8
				</span></i>
			 (= <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.524
			</span></i>, where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κνήσας</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
